[en.FOCUS_C01_DEM_INVESTIGATION]
Bearing the Crown

[en.FOCUS_C01_DEM_INVESTIGATION_desc]
In chess, a pawn, in rare occasions, can be promoted to a queen, yet a rook can not promote to a queen. Though, in casual play, an upside-down rook may designate a queen, this is never recognized in official play.\nSo when you place a rook upside-down, you’ll be paying the price of bearing the crown.

[en.FOCUS_C01_DEM_INVESTIGATION_TOOLTIP]
§RCozy Glow will no longer handle affairs in the way she used to.§!

[zh.FOCUS_C01_DEM_INVESTIGATION]
必承其重

[zh.FOCUS_C01_DEM_INVESTIGATION_desc]
在国际象棋中，兵有时可以晋升为皇后，但车却不能晋升为皇后。虽然在休闲比赛中，倒置的车可能代表皇后，但在正式比赛中这是不被承认的。\n所以当你把车倒置时，你将付出戴上皇冠的代价。

[zh.FOCUS_C01_DEM_INVESTIGATION_TOOLTIP]
§R和煦光流将不再按照以前的方式处理事务。§!

